-Closes roadmap items 1-3 in section 1 (DIGITIKA ACADEMY): Digitika was
-enrollment+payment only, students had nowhere to go after paying.
-
-Schema: CourseModule, Lesson (VIDEO/TEXT/QUIZ/RESOURCE), LessonProgress,
-Quiz/QuizQuestion/QuizAttempt (graded server-side), Certificate (opaque
-verifyToken, snapshots student/course name at issue time).
-
-RBAC: added 'content' and 'certificates' modules to digitika-rbac-catalog.ts,
-auto-generates permissions via the existing generic seed script.
-
-Admin API: CRUD for modules/lessons, quiz authoring (PUT replaces a lesson's
-quiz+questions transactionally).
-
-Student-facing API (gated by existing Student-ID + paid-enrollment lookup —
-see digitika-access.ts docblock for the known limitation this carries over):
-GET content, POST complete-lesson, POST quiz-attempt, POST/GET certificate.
-
-Certificates render as PDF in-process via pdf-lib, no third-party service.
-Public unauthenticated verify page at /certificates/[token].
-
-UI: /digitika/[courseId]/learn — Student-ID gate, lesson sidebar w/ progress,
-video/text/resource/quiz viewers, certificate CTA at 100% completion.
-
-NOT done here: admin content-authoring UI (API only), real video
-streaming/hosting (plain URL field until a provider is chosen), cert
-issuance notifications.
